[Bo2's Example 6.1 (DC, second order)]

e,3,0,9
r2,3,1,5
r1,1,0,5
l,1,2,1/2
c,2,0,1/8
r3,2,0,2

analysis: dc
note: The first second-order circuit: an inductor and a capacitor in the same network. Find i(t) and v(t) for all t; this DC interval gives vc = 2 V and il = 1 A.
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/bo2s-example-6-1-30.jpg
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


