r1,1,0,5
l,1,2,1/2,1
c,2,0,1/8,2

analysis: tr
note: Second interval in TR: two exponentials now. Find vc and il, built from e^(-2t) and e^(-8t).
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/bo2s-example-6-1-30.jpg
rounding: exact
